# Login Test Cases

## Application
SauceDemo - https://www.saucedemo.com/

## Module
Login

| Test Case ID | Test Scenario | Test Steps | Expected Result | Actual Result | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| TC_01 | Valid login | Enter standard_user and secret_sauce, then click Login | User should log in successfully | User logged in successfully | Pass |
| TC_02 | Invalid username | Enter an invalid username and valid password | Error message should appear | Not tested | Not Run |
| TC_03 | Invalid password | Enter standard_user and wrong123 | Error message should appear | Username and password do not match any user in the service | Pass |
| TC_04 | Both fields empty | Click Login without entering details | Required field validation should appear | Not tested | Not Run |
| TC_05 | Empty username | Enter secret_sauce as password and leave username empty | Username required message should appear | Username is required | Pass |
| TC_06 | Empty password | Enter standard_user and leave password empty | Password required message should appear | Password is required | Pass |
| TC_07 | Locked user | Enter locked_out_user and secret_sauce | Login should be blocked with an error message | User was blocked with a locked-out message | Pass |

## Notes
- Testing was performed manually on SauceDemo.
- Pass status is based on the observed result matching the expected result.
- Test cases marked Not Run have not been executed.
